    "directions": [
      "In a large bowl add sweet potatoes, cheese, coriander, green chili, aamchur powder, red chili powder and salt. Mix all the ingredients using a masher or with a fork.",
      "Stuff the cleaned mushrooms with the stuffing. Thread 2 mushrooms on to a small skewer or a tooth pick",
      "Make a thick batter using flour, water and salt; dip the mushrooms in the batter, then coat them in bread crumbs and deep fry in hot oil in a deep pan.",
      "When done rest them on a paper towel and serve hot ."
